      <nav class="product-nav" aria-label="Product information"><div class="container"><span class="nav-product">G31</span><div class="nav-links"><a class="active" href="#features">Features</a><a href="#specs">Specifications</a><a href="#box">In the box</a><a href="#support">Support</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></div><a class="nav-up" href="#purchase">Choose G31 ↑</a></div></nav>
      <section class="section features-section" id="features"><div class="container"><div class="center-heading"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGNED TO BE USEFUL</p><h2>Built around the way you travel.</h2><p>Energy for daily use, visibility from your phone, and an installation you can plan.</p></div><div class="feature-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="G31 features"><button type="button" role="tab" id="feature-tab-0" data-feature="0" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="g31-feature-panel-0" tabindex="0">Daily power</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="feature-tab-1" data-feature="1" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="g31-feature-panel-1" tabindex="-1">Bluetooth monitoring</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="feature-tab-2" data-feature="2" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="g31-feature-panel-2" tabindex="-1">Installation</button></div><div class="feature-panel" role="tabpanel" id="g31-feature-panel-0" aria-labelledby="feature-tab-0" ><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Daily power</p><h3>Power the essentials<br>that make it your RV.</h3><p>Plan around your 12V loads, from lights to compatible pumps and accessories. The G31 stores 1,280Wh; actual runtime depends on the loads, system losses and conditions.</p><div class="feature-metrics"><div><strong>100Ah</strong><span>Nominal capacity</span></div><div><strong>1,280Wh</strong><span>Nominal stored energy</span></div></div><small>For auxiliary and deep-cycle use. This battery is not an engine-starting battery.</small></div><div class="feature-image"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-hero.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-hero-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-hero-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-hero.webp' | asset_url }} 2200w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="SuntNeew battery shown in an RV compartment at a lakeside stop" width="2200" height="1467" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div><div class="feature-panel" role="tabpanel" id="g31-feature-panel-1" aria-labelledby="feature-tab-1" hidden><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Bluetooth monitoring</p><h3>Check the battery.<br>Stay in the moment.</h3><p>Bluetooth 5.0 puts supported battery information on your phone, so checking the system does not have to mean opening the battery compartment.</p><div class="feature-metrics"><div><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong><span>App monitoring</span></div><div><strong>12.8V</strong><span>Nominal battery voltage</span></div></div><small>App illustrations show the monitoring concept. Available readings depend on the supported app and connection.</small></div><div class="feature-image"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-bluetooth.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-bluetooth-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-bluetooth-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-bluetooth.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Bluetooth phone monitoring illustration beside the installed battery" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div><div class="feature-panel" role="tabpanel" id="g31-feature-panel-2" aria-labelledby="feature-tab-2" hidden><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Installation</p><h3>Measure first.<br>Make the space work.</h3><p>Match the case dimensions to the tray and restraint. Leave room for the terminals, cable bends and safe servicing before you install.</p><div class="feature-metrics"><div><strong>339 × 185 × 218mm</strong><span>Battery case dimensions</span></div><div><strong>9.6kg</strong><span>Battery net weight</span></div></div><small>A Group 31 label alone does not confirm the fit in every compartment.</small></div><div class="feature-image"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-install.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-install-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-install-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-install.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Group 31 battery in a tray with restraints" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></div></section>
      <section class="section container reliability"><div class="split-media"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-main.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew Group 31 battery exterior, enclosure and terminal layout" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-main-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-main-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-main.webp' | asset_url }} 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="981"></div><div class="split-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PROTECTION FOR EVERYDAY RV USE</p><h2>A clear role for<br>every protection.</h2><p>The BMS manages the battery within its operating limits. The IP65 enclosure protects against dust and water jets. Correct charging, fusing and installation complete the system.</p><div class="protection-points"><div><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-shield"></use></svg><span><strong>BMS protection</strong><small>Charge, discharge and temperature safeguards.</small></span></div><div><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-drop"></use></svg><span><strong>IP65 enclosure</strong><small>Dust-tight and protected against water jets.</small></span></div></div><small class="fineprint">IP65 is not an immersion rating. Use a suitable LiFePO4 charger and follow the manual’s temperature limits.</small></div></section>
      <section class="practical-section"><div class="container practical"><div class="split-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A PRACTICAL UPGRADE</p><h2>Make installation<br>easier to handle.</h2><p>The integrated handle and 9.6kg battery weight help with positioning and servicing. Plan the hold-down, cable path and access around your actual RV compartment.</p><div class="feature-metrics"><div><strong>9.6kg</strong><span>Battery net weight</span></div><div><strong>Group 31</strong><span>Check exact dimensions</span></div></div><small class="fineprint">Secure the battery correctly. Installation illustrations are examples, not a universal fit guarantee.</small></div><div class="practical-media"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-lightweight.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Lifting the Group 31 battery by its handle" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-lightweight-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-lightweight-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-lightweight.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1600" height="1067"></div></div></section>

      <section class="section setup-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOUR FIRST USE</p><h2>Plan the system before the trip.</h2></div><p>Start with fit, charging and the load. The full manual takes you through the battery’s installation and operating requirements.</p></div><div class="setup-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Measure</h3><p>Confirm tray, restraint and terminal clearance.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Match the charger</h3><p>Use compatible 14.4–14.6V LiFePO4 charging.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Plan protection</h3><p>Size the system wiring and fusing correctly.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Check &amp; monitor</h3><p>Verify the installation and app connection.</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-manual-en-fr-de.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the full G31 manual <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-download"></use></svg></a></div></section>
      <section class="section container box-section" id="box"><span class="g31-legacy-anchor" id="in-the-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="box-image"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-kit.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="G31 kit and included accessories" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-kit-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-kit-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-kit.webp' | asset_url }} 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="1200"></div><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR KIT</p><h2>What comes<br>with your G31.</h2><ul class="kit-list"><li><span>✓</span>Group 31 LiFePO4 battery × 1</li><li><span>✓</span>Terminal screws × 2</li><li><span>✓</span>Terminal washers × 2</li><li><span>✓</span>Insulating caps × 2</li><li><span>✓</span>User manual × 1</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-manual-en-fr-de.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Group 31 user manual · EN / FR / DE <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-download"></use></svg></a></div></section>
      <section class="section specs-section" id="specs"><span class="g31-legacy-anchor" id="specifications" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="container specs-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DETAILS</p><h2>Know your G31.</h2><p>12.8V · 100Ah · Bluetooth</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-manual-en-fr-de.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the manual <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-download"></use></svg></a></div><div class="specs-table"><dl><div><dt>Chemistry / use</dt><dd>LiFePO4 / deep-cycle auxiliary power</dd></div><div><dt>Nominal voltage / capacity</dt><dd>12.8V / 100Ah</dd></div><div><dt>Stored energy</dt><dd>1,280Wh</dd></div><div><dt>Case dimensions</dt><dd>339 × 185 × 218mm</dd></div><div><dt>Net weight</dt><dd>9.6kg / 21.2lb</dd></div><div><dt>Charging voltage</dt><dd>14.4–14.6V LiFePO4 charging</dd></div></dl><details class="more-specs"><summary>More specifications <span>+</span></summary><dl>{%- for block in section.blocks -%}{%- if block.type == 'spec' -%}<div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><dt>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ block.settings.value | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</dl></details>
<details class="g31-documents" id="manuals"><summary>Manuals &amp; documents <span>+</span></summary><div><a href="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-manual-en-fr-de.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Group 31 manual · EN / FR / DE <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-download"/></svg></a><a href="{{ pages['support-rv-g31'].url | default: '/pages/support-rv-g31' }}#manual">Online manual &amp; installation help <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="{{ pages['support-rv-g31'].url | default: '/pages/support-rv-g31' }}#certifications">Model documents &amp; compliance references <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a></div></details></div></div></section>
      <section class="section reviews-section" id="reviews"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FROM OUR CUSTOMERS</p><h2>Out on the road.</h2><div class="g31-live-reviews">{%- for block in section.blocks -%}{%- if block.type == '@app' -%}{% render block %}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</div></div></section>
      <section class="care-section" id="support"><span class="g31-legacy-anchor" id="support-certificates" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="container care-layout"><div class="care-promise"><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW, AFTER THE SALE</p><span class="warranty-number">5<span>YEAR</span></span><h2>Covered for the long road.</h2><p>Your G31 includes a five-year limited warranty for eligible defects. And a place to turn for product and setup questions.</p><button type="button" class="text-link" data-policy="warranty">See your warranty <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"></use></svg></button></div><div class="care-details"><h3>A little more peace of mind.</h3><button type="button" data-policy="shipping"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-truck"></use></svg><span><strong>From U.S. stock to your door.</strong><small>Free standard delivery to the contiguous 48 states + DC.</small></span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-chevron"></use></svg></button><button type="button" data-policy="returns"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-return"></use></svg><span><strong>14 days to request a return.</strong><small>For eligible items. Contact us for approval before returning.</small></span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-chevron"></use></svg></button><button type="button" data-policy="support"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-help"></use></svg><span><strong>Questions now. Support later.</strong><small>Lifetime technical support for your SuntNeew product.</small></span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-chevron"></use></svg></button><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ pages['contact-us'].url | default: '/pages/contact-us' }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Talk to SuntNeew <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"></use></svg></a></div></div></section>
      <section class="section container faq-section" id="faq"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU GO</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2><p>More questions about your G31?</p><button type="button" class="text-link" data-policy="support">We’re here to help <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"></use></svg></button></div><div class="faq-group"><details><summary>Can this battery start my RV engine?<span>+</span></summary><p>No. The Group 31 is a LiFePO4 deep-cycle battery for auxiliary and energy-storage systems. It is not an engine-starting battery.</p></details><details><summary>Will it fit every Group 31 battery tray?<span>+</span></summary><p>Check the exact 339 × 185 × 218mm dimensions, your hold-down arrangement, terminal access and cable clearance. The group size alone does not confirm physical fit.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use my existing lead-acid charger?<span>+</span></summary><p>Use compatible 14.4–14.6V LiFePO4 charging as specified in the manual. A charger with a lead-acid-only mode may not be suitable.</p></details><details><summary>Does IP65 mean the battery can be submerged?<span>+</span></summary><p>No. IP65 covers dust and water-jet protection under the applicable rating conditions. It is not an immersion rating.</p></details></div></section>
      <section class="closing-banner"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW / G31</p><h2>Make more of the road.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="#purchase">Choose your G31 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"></use></svg></a></div></section>

<aside class="sticky-buy" id="g31-sticky-buy" aria-label="Quick purchase" hidden><div class="container"><div class="sticky-product"><img class="" src="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-main.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'sn-g31-v3-main-320.webp' | asset_url }} 320w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-main-640.webp' | asset_url }} 640w, {{ 'sn-g31-v3-main.webp' | asset_url }} 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="" width="1200" height="981" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><strong>G31</strong><small>12.8V · 100Ah · Bluetooth</small></span></div><strong class="sticky-price" data-g31-price>{{ g31_variant.price | money }}</strong><button type="submit" class="button button-primary" form="{{ product_form_id }}" data-g31-sticky-add {% unless g31_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{% if g31_variant.available %}{{ 'product.general.add_to_cart_button' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'product.general.sold_out_button' | t }}{% endif %} <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-bag"/></svg></button></div></aside>
<dialog class="modal" id="g31-policy-warranty" aria-labelledby="g31-policy-warranty-title"><button type="button" class="modal-close" data-g31-close aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><p class="eyebrow">LONG-TERM COVER</p><h2 id="g31-policy-warranty-title">Five-year limited warranty.</h2><p class="modal-lede">Your SuntNeew G31 includes five years of limited warranty coverage for eligible defects under normal use.</p><div class="modal-body"><h3>Help with your Group 31</h3><p>Contact our team with your order details, model and a description of the fault. Keep your proof of purchase and follow the product manual.</p><h3>Model-specific coverage</h3><p>Contact product support to review the applicable terms and service for your battery.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ pages['support-rv-g31'].url | default: '/pages/support-rv-g31' }}">Group 31 product support <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a></dialog>
<dialog class="modal" id="g31-policy-returns" aria-labelledby="g31-policy-returns-title"><button type="button" class="modal-close" data-g31-close aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR RETURN WINDOW</p><h2 id="g31-policy-returns-title">14-day returns.</h2><p class="modal-lede">Request an eligible return within 14 days after delivery. Contact us for approval and an RMA before shipping.</p><div class="modal-body"><h3>What is eligible?</h3><p>Unused items in resalable condition, with the original packaging, accessories and proof of purchase.</p><h3>Return shipping</h3><p>For a change of mind or an incorrectly chosen model, the customer pays return shipping. The published policy explains the handling of damaged, defective or incorrect items.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ pages['return-policy'].url | default: '/pages/return-policy' }}">Full return policy <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a></dialog>
<dialog class="modal" id="g31-policy-shipping" aria-labelledby="g31-policy-shipping-title"><button type="button" class="modal-close" data-g31-close aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><p class="eyebrow">U.S. DELIVERY</p><h2 id="g31-policy-shipping-title">Free standard shipping.</h2><p class="modal-lede">Delivery to the contiguous 48 United States and Washington, DC, from available U.S. stock.</p><div class="modal-body"><h3>Processing and transit</h3><p>Allow 2 business days for processing, plus an estimated 2–5 business days in transit after dispatch. Business days are Monday–Friday.</p><h3>Delivery area</h3><p>Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, other U.S. territories, military addresses and destinations outside the U.S. are excluded.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ pages['shipping-policy'].url | default: '/pages/shipping-policy' }}">Full shipping policy <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a></dialog>
<dialog class="modal" id="g31-policy-support" aria-labelledby="g31-policy-support-title"><button type="button" class="modal-close" data-g31-close aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE & AFTER YOUR PURCHASE</p><h2 id="g31-policy-support-title">A place to turn.</h2><p class="modal-lede">Get lifetime technical support for your G31, from compatibility questions to setup and use.</p><div class="modal-body"><h3>Start with the right information</h3><p>Tell us the product model and your question. For an order or service issue, include the order number and clear photos where useful.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ pages['contact-us'].url | default: '/pages/contact-us' }}">Contact SuntNeew <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sn-g31-icon-arrow"/></svg></a></dialog>
<dialog class="modal image-modal" id="g31-image-dialog" aria-labelledby="g31-image-dialog-title"><button type="button" class="modal-close" data-g31-close aria-label="Close image">×</button><h2 class="sr-only" id="g31-image-dialog-title">Product image</h2><img alt="" width="1200" height="1200" decoding="async"></dialog>
